- `POST /analytics/v1/click/event/{eventId}` — Record an analytics click event.
- `POST /click/z_prod_web/{z_prod_webId}` — Record a click event on a Zillow product.
- `POST /metrics/rum` — Send real user monitoring data.

### Realtime (1)
